    "description": "<p>AURA DIVINITY FEAR UNLIVING-MUMMY</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 8</p>\n<p>Your presence carries the weight of sealed doom and the silence of the grave.</p>\n<p>You emanate a 30-foot aura of despair. A living creature that begins its turn in the aura or enters it must attempt a Will save with the following results:</p>\n<p>Heroic The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p>Critical The creature is frightened 1.</p>\n<p>Success The creature is frightened 2.</p>\n<p>Partial The creature is frightened 3.</p>\n<p>Failure The creature is frightened 3 and paralyzed for 1 round.</p>\n<p>Fumble The creature is frightened 4 and paralyzed for 1 round.</p>\n<p>Blunder The creature collapses from fear and is reduced to 0 hit points, gaining unconscious condition.</p>\n<p>The creature is immune to paralysis for 24 hours after making a save but not the fear.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a 30-foot aura; a living creature starting its turn in it or entering it rolls Will against your Level DC and takes the ladder's fear (and paralysis). A creature that has saved is immune to the paralysis for 24 hours, not to the fear.</p>",
